+        "\n" +
+        "## 4. What to ask the user for (and how they get it)\n" +
+        "\n" +
+        "Ask only for what you need, one step at a time, in the user's language. **Mode A** (questions about the app) usually needs nothing but the user's description or a screenshot. **Mode B** (generate/change an attack) needs the three `.txt` files below.\n" +
