+        "| 7..10 | `XSPEED_A…YACCEL_A` | the same four for the air |\n" +
+        "| 11 | `COMP` | next reaction code after this step (0 = none; 1..29 game reaction; 30..49 character slot) — \"SEQ\" lane |\n" +
+        "| 12 | `WALL` | wall behaviour: with 2 or 3, if the defender touches the wall during the step, the reaction restarts at `COMP`; 0 = nothing |\n" +
+        "| 13 | `VOZ` | voice sound id (1..127; 0 = none) played at the start of the step |\n" +
+        "\n" +
+        "Each step **restarts the defender's animation** (ANO). The empty slots of the character (no rows) can be filled with the app (copy from the game data, copy from another slot, import from another character, or blank).\n" +
+        "\n" +
+        "### 5.5 HDAT 4 — fields of a move (`$GOLPE_i`)\n" +
+        "\n" +
+        "{{HDAT4_TABLE}}\n" +
+        "\n" +
+        "**`ATK_FLAGS` bits** (sum the values you want):\n" +
+        "\n" +
