+        "\n" +
+        "## 9. Validation checklist (run it mentally before delivering data)\n" +
+        "\n" +
+        "1. Syntax: every `{` closes; keys are known; `$MPT_i` numbered 0.. consecutively; every frame has `$IMG`; the ANO has ≥ 1 frame.\n" +
+        "2. Per ANO: ≤ 255 frames; ≤ 13 links, no link-of-link; each `$LINK` `$ANO` exists.\n" +
+        "3. Per frame: ≤ 10 `$HITS`; `$TIME` ≤ 255 (and present unless a frozen frame is intended); `$IMG` < number of `$SPR_` entries; `$OPT` `d1` ≤ 249 and a hitbox exists when `d1` matters.\n" +
+        "4. A move: `ANIM_INICIAL` exists; every referenced ANO number exists (0 = none); no SEQ to its own ANO; if it grabs (8/128) it must not also use `MAX_REPETICOES` or have a SEQ with 128.\n" +
