+        "7. Interpolation (`$OPT` d2 ≠ 0): next frame has `$RAZ` and the same number of boxes.\n" +
+        "8. New ANO numbers do not collide with existing ones or the reserved 201–255 effect range (unless intended).\n" +
+        "9. Reaction rows: 14 values/columns, speeds −128..127, `DUR` ≥ 1, `$ROW`/`$SZ` consistent when hand-editing.\n" +
+        "\n" +
+        "## 10. How to test in the app\n" +
+        "\n" +
+        "1. Open the character (`CHAR`), choose the move (`MODO: GOLPES`) or the ANO (`MODO: ANO`).\n" +
+        "2. Press play (`TOCAR`) or drag the time bar / timeline; use `-1` / `+1` to step tick by tick; `INICIO` resets.\n" +
