+        "## 11. Screens and buttons (what each control does)\n" +
+        "\n" +
+        "### 11.0 Title bar\n" +
+        "`↻` reloads the folders the app reads (asks for confirmation; unsaved edits are lost; keeps the same character, opponent and move when the folders still exist) — use it after the user adds, deletes or replaces a character folder or a `.txt` file. `PT` / `EN` / `ES` switches the app language instantly. `AJUDA` opens the in-app help (chapters, search, and the button that creates this file).\n" +
+        "\n" +
+        "### 11.1 Top menu (14 buttons; the user can long-press and drag them to reorder; the first is pinned)\n" +
+        "- `SALVAR` — save (section 13).\n" +
+        "- `CHAR` — choose the **attacker** and the **opponent** characters; `POS` sets distance/height between them by dragging on screen (and `FLY`: attacker airborne); `CHAR OBJ` shows body box and sprite anchors and edits the body size.\n" +
+        "- `SPRITES` — the character's sprite list: add, replace, remove, reorder, change the cut, import PNG/JPG/GIF; also choose the sprite for a frame.\n" +
+        "- `LINKS` — linked animations of the current ANO (list, edit, sync flags `SPAWN_POS`/`XY`/`MPT`, edit position over the base animation).\n" +
+        "- `GOLPE SET` — the move's `ATK_FLAGS` options (checkboxes; table in 5.5).\n" +
+        "- `HITBOX` — draw boxes on the preview (red hit, blue hurt, yellow others).\n" +
+        "- `TEMPO` — NORMAL / ESTENDIDO / ATAQUE playback modes.\n" +
+        "- `CENTRO` — camera NORMAL (free, pinch to zoom) / TELA (game camera 480×320) / CHAR (auto-frame both).\n" +
+        "- `POUSO` — ON/OFF landing & fall ANO changes.\n" +
+        "- `TRANSIÇÃO` — LIVRE/TRAVADA: freeze ANO switching from the current frame (only for moves with a sequence).\n" +
