+        "\n" +
+        "### 11.2 Timeline\n" +
+        "Tap a sprite clip to open its drawer. Lanes: SPRITES (yellow clips), then hitbox/hurtbox/projectile/effect/special-action lanes, SOM (blue), VELOCIDADE (green), ESTILO (orange: flip/transform), LINKS, TRANSIÇÕES (SEQ/END/landing marks). `＋` adds at the pointer (sprite, hitbox, hurtbox, projectile, effect, sound, speed, link, special action); `#` filters lanes. Tool row: `DIVIDIR` splits a clip/item at the pointer, `DUPLICAR`, `EXCLUIR`, `DESFAZER`. Drag a clip's edge to change its duration; drag item edges to trim. Pinch = zoom; vertical drag scrolls lanes.\n" +
