+        "8. **`PlayerTail`** (jogo:29714-29899), the common per-tick fighter tail: `DamageMove` knock-back, `GuardCancelTime--`, `_SetXY` from `PlayerXPos/YPos`; if `iHitStop != 0` → `wActFlag |= 4` (freeze) and `CancelTime = 20` when it was 0 (jogo:29777-29783), otherwise unfreeze and decrement `CancelTime` (jogo:29784-29790); `_ActReq` (animation script) + `ChrSePlay` (skipped when md 925); `PlayerXPos/YPos` rebuilt from `objExec`; **hit boxes of type 0 spawn a projectile task md 970** (prio 13312+p, jogo:29808-29878) subject to `BulletAction[p][0] != 0 && BulletNum < 8` (count 3 if `SpecialKind & 4`; spawn position by `SpecialKind` bit 32/64); then `PlayerState &= -50069508` (clears the per-frame flag bits, jogo:29884) and **`CheckOptFlag`** (jogo:29885).\n" +
+        "9. **Hit detect md 935** (prio 13728, created at jogo:5677): `CheckObjHit` finds attacker type-2 boxes against defender type-1 boxes; then `DamageChange(gw, att, def, true, true, atk.ano, atk.OptData[0], atk.OptData[1] & 255, atk.wOptFlag)` (jogo:23464); projectile hits use jogo:23424.\n" +
