+        "**What `Run`, `Init`, `_ActReqMain` and `CheckOptFlag` are [CODE].** `Run` (jogo:29937): scheduler pass over the task list, then `Draw`. `Init` (jogo:28611): engine start, calls `InitGameData` (jogo:29127). `_ActReqMain` (jogo:31772-32047): the **ANO interpreter** (one pattern per call, see 15.8) — it is **not** an attack function. `CheckOptFlag` (jogo:2112): per-tick processor of the **hit-box action flags** and `wOptFlag` bits (shake, cutscene, teleport, heal, dust…); it does not decide attacks.\n" +
