+        "**Effects created by hit flags [CODE].** Flags 10–17: effect-pack ANO `50 + flag − 10` (dust/smoke). Flags 41–70: `charf` pack ANO `flag − 41 + 3` (bubbles; never mirrored). Flags 71–125: the **character's own DAC**, ANO `201 + flag − 71` (auras/effects; inherit the owner's flip unless the effect's frame has a type-0 box). They live while the flag is present in the owner's current frame (tracked in `AuraAction[player][63]`, md 976/978), at offset `(hit.x, hit.y)` mirrored by facing. `wOptFlag` bits 4096·t (t = 1..15): dust task md 961 at the feet (t 1–5 → bobj ANO 10–14, 6–7 → effect ANO 78–79, ≥ 8 → effect ANO 70+(t−8); +80 when facing left); bit 2048: wall-impact effect (effect ANO 12, SE 6, `CancelTime[opp] = 0`, only after `DamageWall`); bit 1024: `PlayerState |= 1` (hides the background, blocks wall detection).\n" +
